{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47307","headline":"步虚词十首 六 · 吴筠","name":"步虚词十首 六","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"琼台劫万仞，孤映大罗表。\n常有三素云，凝光自飞绕。\n羽幢泛明霞，升降何缥缈。\n鸾凤吹雅音，栖翔绦林标。\n玉虚无昼夜，灵景何皎皎。\n一覩太上京，方知衆天小。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47307.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47307","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}